WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.760
If you desire a fresh and youthful look, a look that you have lost due to sagging skin,

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:10.400
loss of volume and accentuation of wrinkles, a face lift is the right option for you.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:14.960
I will explain why. A face lift goes far beyond lifting the skin.

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:21.040
When we perform this procedure, we also mobilize the layer of tissue that covers, invests,

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:25.840
and connects the muscles of the face and neck, also known as the SMAS layer.

00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:32.240
Lifting this layer allows us to achieve a natural and harmonious improvement

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:37.520
in the appearance of the skin and also in the expression of the face.

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:42.240
In this way, the result is much more durable. In addition, we can use advanced

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:48.080
filler techniques to give volume to areas that have lost it and get an even more powerful

00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:54.480
result in the youthfulness that the face reflects. The vast majority of our patients

00:00:54.480 --> 00:01:01.440
says that they feel that they have rejuvenated ten years in time. That is the case of Caroline,

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:06.800
whose photos you are watching right now and with whom we achieved this magnificent result.

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:13.760
However, due to the complexity of the facial tissue and the large number of nerves that the

00:01:13.760 --> 00:01:20.160
face has, it is extremely important that this procedure will be performed by a board-certified

00:01:20.160 --> 00:01:26.880
plastic surgeon. Let me introduce myself. I'm Dr. Fulvio Correa, a board-certified plastic surgeon.

00:01:26.880 --> 00:01:31.600
Through our all-inclusive program that we have designed especially for patients

00:01:31.600 --> 00:01:39.040
come from other countries like you. My staff will accompany you in every phase of the journey,

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:44.000
answering all your questions, helping you to plan your trip, scheduling your accommodation in

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:49.360
our recovery house, where you will have all the comforts and care necessary for a prompt

00:01:49.360 --> 00:01:54.560
and satisfactory recovery. Schedule your free evaluation right now and start your journey

00:01:55.120 --> 00:01:58.640
to achieve your goals and boost your confidence.
